cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software in your work, please cite it using this metadata.
title: auto-doc-engine
abstract: >-
  An AST-driven research-document toolkit for JSON/CSV/YAML data binding,
  typed Markdown parsing, structural change reporting, cross-document graph
  diagnostics, bounded research frontmatter, SARIF 2.1.0 result interchange,
  optional multi-format synchronization, and RO-Crate 1.3 metadata packaging.
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/lostlight530/auto-doc-engine
authors:
  - name: lostlight530
    url: https://github.com/lostlight530
keywords:
  - markdown
  - ast
  - research-software
  - research-objects
  - ro-crate
  - sarif
  - provenance
  - structural-diff
  - document-graph
  - reproducibility
